- It was written and verified end-to-end on a locked-down corporate Windows 11
- laptop (admin user, NVIDIA RTX A3000 12 GB, with a TLS-inspecting corporate proxy).
- The corporate-network sections are not hypothetical; skipping them makes the
- model download fail.
